1
00:01:57,033 --> 00:01:57,780
Master Thep

2
00:01:59,020 --> 00:01:59,901
My Lord

3
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:02,910
Where are you going?

4
00:02:03,735 --> 00:02:05,593
I was going to find you in the capital.

5
00:02:05,723 --> 00:02:06,818
What’s happened at home?

6
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:08,500
Bu- nga

7
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:10,060
- Bu- nga
- Be careful Thep.

8
00:02:11,292 --> 00:02:12,387
What's wrong with her?

9
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,827
Khem

10
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:16,080
Tell me What happened?

11
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,580
It was life or death.

12
00:02:18,740 --> 00:02:20,340
Why no telegram?

13
00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:21,900
If I hadn't returned

14
00:02:22,215 --> 00:02:24,566
I’d never have known.

15
00:02:31,095 --> 00:02:34,340
Did you hear me? She tried kill me

16
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,067
You're biased.

17
00:02:36,504 --> 00:02:38,660
You blame her for everything.

18
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,860
And aren't you biased against me?

19
00:02:40,947 --> 00:02:43,796
We'll part ways as I've decided.

20
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,500
Let go of me

21
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:48,700
Mother

22
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,740
- Duangkhae
- Mother

23
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,012
- Duangkhae
- Mother

24
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,267
Let's get engaged.

25
00:02:57,820 --> 00:03:00,344
If I hadn't trusted all of you

26
00:03:01,704 --> 00:03:04,110
I wouldn't be suffering like this.

27
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,707
The fortune teller said...

28
00:03:10,769 --> 00:03:13,126
everything...stems from a curse.

29
00:03:13,261 --> 00:03:15,772
What should we do?

30
00:03:15,907 --> 00:03:17,220
I need to find out...

31
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:19,180
who cursed my family.

32
00:03:24,787 --> 00:03:27,686
Say that you permit me to enter.

33
00:03:28,012 --> 00:03:30,060
You have permission to enter.

34
00:03:32,498 --> 00:03:34,380
Uncle

35
00:03:35,027 --> 00:03:36,609
What is it?

36
00:03:50,941 --> 00:03:52,940
Do you know her too?

37
00:03:53,483 --> 00:03:54,260
No.

38
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,353
Help

39
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,420
Help

40
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:26,380
Is anyone there? Help

41
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:27,780
Help

42
00:04:37,780 --> 00:04:38,700
Master?

43
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,673
Keep this for emergencies.

44
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,643
Protect my wife and child.

45
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:45,660
Yes sir.

46
00:05:59,507 --> 00:06:00,340
Ah

47
00:08:21,452 --> 00:08:22,818
Something wrong?

48
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,200
Nothing.

49
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,270
I miss you.

50
00:12:03,950 --> 00:12:07,329
Ploy what’s for breakfast?
It smells different.

51
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,932
Good morning Dad.

52
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,356
Morning.

53
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,473
This is so good

54
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,240
Really?

55
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,098
What is it?

56
00:12:22,184 --> 00:12:23,753
Chicken curry with rice.

57
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,230
Let me try some.

58
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:44,898
It's really good.

59
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:01,292
Jomthap have some curry.

60
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,852
Okay.

61
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,018
Help yourself.

62
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,880
Good isn't it?

63
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,892
What are you cooking?

64
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,329
Chicken curry with rice.

65
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,101
It's for the Lady to taste.

66
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,283
Anyone who tastes your curry...

67
00:13:38,387 --> 00:13:41,138
will surely fall in love with it.

68
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,163
Where's Mommy?

69
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,335
I saw her go out.

70
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,529
Did she say where to?

71
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,870
We didn't speak.

72
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,289
She isn't answering.

73
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,230
Did you argue yesterday?

74
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,741
No.

75
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:41,076
But Ploy's been depressed...

76
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,787
since she lost her mother.

77
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:46,972
I moved my family here
hoping she’d recover

78
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,876
but it hasn't helped.

79
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,966
If we can't find her

80
00:14:55,095 --> 00:14:56,166
in a few hours

81
00:14:56,880 --> 00:14:58,652
we'll file a police report.

82
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,415
In her state of mind

83
00:15:01,556 --> 00:15:02,904
she could be in danger.

84
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,073
I should have installed cameras.

85
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,196
I was so busy with work and renovations

86
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:11,667
that it slipped my mind.

87
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,935
I'll try calling her as well.

88
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,166
Thank you.

89
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:24,726
Is it spicy?

90
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,304
Need anything else Jomthap?

91
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:36,440
Oh.

92
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,636
No.

93
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,356
Aren't you going to eat?

94
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:42,350
I already ate.

95
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,489
I'll wait outside.

96
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,895
Hello?

97
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,830
Any news on my great- grandfather?

98
00:17:38,886 --> 00:17:40,320
I've searched everywhere

99
00:17:40,406 --> 00:17:42,092
but I can't find the funeral book

100
00:17:42,135 --> 00:17:43,883
for Luang Decha.

101
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:48,430
No records mention his death either.

102
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:52,086
We only have Lady Mok’s history...

103
00:17:52,196 --> 00:17:54,153
from her funeral book.

104
00:17:54,375 --> 00:17:58,646
It says she was widowed
after Luang vanished.

105
00:17:58,840 --> 00:17:59,907
Vanished?

106
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:00,640
Yes.

107
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:04,750
He disappeared right after
his first wife died.

108
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,498
What about his eldest son?

109
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:07,489
Thep?

110
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,107
I don't know either.

111
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,000
In that case

112
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:13,643
we'll never find anything about his family.

113
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,147
I’m afraid so.

114
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:17,080
I see.

115
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,033
Thank you.

116
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:41,480
I only found records of Raj

117
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:44,313
son of Luang and Lady Mok

118
00:18:44,387 --> 00:18:46,190
and your great- grandfather.

119
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:49,046
To be precise

120
00:18:49,255 --> 00:18:51,040
Luang and Lady Mok

121
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:53,920
are your great- great- grandparents to you.

122
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:21,150
Search your house again.

123
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,556
I think the answers

124
00:19:23,630 --> 00:19:26,381
are in that house.

125
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,292
She's a human.

126
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,240
Not a slave.

127
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:54,560
Not an animal.
You can't just lock her up.

128
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:56,061
Why not?

129
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,424
Or shall we send her away?

130
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,289
I'm not going back.

131
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:03,040
I'll wait here for Thep here.

132
00:20:18,520 --> 00:20:20,461
I just remembered I have class.

133
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:23,009
No time to drop off Chanchao.

134
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:27,400
Wait.

135
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,181
Nuntan’s class?

136
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,166
Isn't there an exam today?

137
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,510
What's wrong?

138
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:57,138
Where did she go?

139
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:56,276
It's hollow inside.

140
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:57,575
If you want it fixed

141
00:22:57,649 --> 00:23:00,246
we'll need to discuss the details.

142
00:23:01,520 --> 00:23:02,830
Let me think about it.

143
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,846
Sure.

144
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,240
Whoa

145
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:31,230
Are you okay?

146
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,578
What do you want from me?

147
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:39,273
You died and forgot everything.

148
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,560
But I'm the only one...

149
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:45,267
who remembers.

150
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,320
Why am I...

151
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,409
the only one left suffering?

152
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,815
What did I ever do to you?

153
00:25:08,080 --> 00:25:09,280
Look at me.

154
00:25:13,950 --> 00:25:15,120
I said look

155
00:25:16,313 --> 00:25:18,307
Or do I have to gouge your eyes out?

156
00:25:20,941 --> 00:25:22,886
Look me in the eyes.

157
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:25,200
I said look

158
00:25:26,153 --> 00:25:27,200
Look

159
00:25:36,412 --> 00:25:38,640
You stole Thep from me.

160
00:25:42,320 --> 00:25:44,129
I was there first...

161
00:25:45,360 --> 00:25:47,840
and I had his child.

162
00:25:54,080 --> 00:25:54,880
Look

163
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:06,172
Come closer.

164
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:25,950
Are you buying my silence with these?

165
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,892
Is that what you think?

166
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:37,760
Since you’re about Ploy’s age...

167
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:40,067
I just wanted your help.

168
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,227
Which ring...

169
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:44,440
looks best...

170
00:26:44,600 --> 00:26:46,030
for Ploy’s engagement?

171
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,646
This one?

172
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,956
Or...

173
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:55,138
This one?

174
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:01,080
Cat got your tongue?

175
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:02,910
Answer the question

176
00:27:03,120 --> 00:27:04,935
What do girls your age like?

177
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:08,160
It's entirely up to you.

178
00:27:10,920 --> 00:27:12,516
Please excuse me
I have to check on my son.

179
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:15,126
I left her with Lady Mok.

180
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:16,480
I don't want to disturb her.

181
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:26,590
You were a first wife too.

182
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:29,556
Why can't you understand
someone in my position?

183
00:27:30,040 --> 00:27:31,064
Why...

184
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:33,249
did you find Thep a new wife?

185
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:36,270
Your marriage is a wreck

186
00:27:36,760 --> 00:27:38,929
so you hate seeing others happy.

187
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:41,292
You have to drag them down with you.

188
00:27:41,347 --> 00:27:43,200
So you'll be satisfied?

189
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:46,600
How dare you

190
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:47,803
Bu- nga

191
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,544
Should I bring her back and slap her?

192
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,867
No.

193
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:56,215
If I hadn't promised my son

194
00:27:56,960 --> 00:28:00,049
she wouldn't be acting so smug.

195
00:28:01,120 --> 00:28:02,153
Just you wait.

196
00:28:02,600 --> 00:28:04,760
Once Thep marries Ploy

197
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:06,320
he'll finally see the truth

198
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:09,267
and see right from wrong.

199
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:15,095
I was right all along.

200
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:17,938
They're tying the knot any day now.

201
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:20,369
Fool you’ve been tricked again.

202
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:29,483
I'm sorry.

203
00:28:30,120 --> 00:28:32,713
I’m just so angry for you.

204
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,427
See

205
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:38,836
They even asked His Highness to preside.

206
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:41,920
Is this the way of breaking it off?

207
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:44,147
It's infuriating.

208
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,603
If Luang had let me go

209
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:49,212
I'd have stopped this.

210
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:19,409
Two months already.

211
00:29:19,483 --> 00:29:21,126
Look how much you’ve grown.

212
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:23,809
Your mother’s been feeding you well.

213
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:27,120
Right?

214
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:34,301
Did you run away from the wedding?

215
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:38,516
I...

216
00:29:39,120 --> 00:29:40,541
I wouldn't dare.

217
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:01,593
Ploy

218
00:30:02,040 --> 00:30:03,181
let's eat

219
00:30:03,320 --> 00:30:05,206
Eat as much as you want now.

220
00:30:05,267 --> 00:30:07,255
Don't worry about fitting into your dress.

221
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:11,298
You know? Even as a bridesmaid

222
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:13,846
but I’m still beaming.

223
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:16,393
So why the long face?

224
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:18,843
Exactly.

225
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:20,920
Hey

226
00:30:21,120 --> 00:30:24,270
Even His Highness came here.

227
00:30:24,720 --> 00:30:26,738
You’re so lucky.

228
00:30:29,280 --> 00:30:31,027
I never thought...

229
00:30:31,175 --> 00:30:34,572
his parents would invite him.

230
00:31:06,320 --> 00:31:08,338
Has His Highness left already?

231
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:16,092
Is something wrong?

232
00:31:19,040 --> 00:31:21,384
He’s presiding over our wedding.

233
00:31:42,040 --> 00:31:43,335
Ploy and I

234
00:31:43,452 --> 00:31:45,827
can't end this as we planned.

235
00:31:48,800 --> 00:31:51,464
You really have to marry another woman...

236
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:55,612
Bu- nga...

237
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:01,993
...even though you have a wife and child?

238
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:04,320
Please listen to me.

239
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,670
I don't want to marry her

240
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,486
but I have no choice.

241
00:32:13,320 --> 00:32:15,360
Then do what you must.

242
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:33,513
I came all this way

243
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,741
to tell her myself.

244
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,507
I hoped she’d understand.

245
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:06,584
Bu- nga

246
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:16,000
(From Somkid Kosaiya)

247
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,270
I've received a letter.

248
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,356
Let me read it to you.

249
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,538
"Dear Bu- nga

250
00:34:30,240 --> 00:34:31,400
I'm so glad

251
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:34,283
to hear you're doing well

252
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:35,249
and that the baby

253
00:34:35,310 --> 00:34:36,935
has started rolling over.

254
00:34:37,520 --> 00:34:40,006
She’ll be crawling before we know it.

255
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:43,040
Actually

256
00:34:43,240 --> 00:34:46,600
I’ve been looking for a house for us

257
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:49,636
so we can live together in the capital.

258
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:53,280
But the political situation

259
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:55,532
is quite worrisome.

260
00:34:55,720 --> 00:35:00,787
It may even lead to bloodshed.

261
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:05,015
I can't share the details in a letter.

262
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,000
And this...

263
00:35:07,160 --> 00:35:11,132
is why I cannot return home yet.

264
00:35:11,760 --> 00:35:13,661
Please be patient Bu- nga.

265
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:14,880
With

266
00:35:15,040 --> 00:35:16,270
all my love

267
00:35:16,640 --> 00:35:17,618
Thepparit.

268
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,147
Bloodshed?

269
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:30,541
He's making up excuses...

270
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:34,147
because he’s obsessed with his new wife.

271
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:38,787
They’re all obsessed with the newcomer.

272
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,480
If you don't believe me

273
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:42,843
come see for yourself.

274
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:54,160
I think for this spot

275
00:35:54,720 --> 00:35:55,600
I want you...

276
00:35:55,680 --> 00:35:56,658
to design...

277
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,800
a house here. Can you?

278
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:00,793
Sure this space looks good.

279
00:36:01,080 --> 00:36:01,600
Right.

280
00:36:02,332 --> 00:36:05,095
This side is a bit narrow.

281
00:36:08,240 --> 00:36:09,772
But if...

282
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:12,098
The reason she...

283
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:14,313
moved you up here...

284
00:36:14,720 --> 00:36:17,981
was to build a house
for her favorite daughter- in- law.

285
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,735
What's so special about her?

286
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:27,920
Even if she's of noble descent

287
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,513
she's still beneath her own people.

288
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,424
Plus she's an orphan.

289
00:36:33,640 --> 00:36:35,993
She's not as pretty as you.

290
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,664
Maybe she used black magic

291
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:44,615
on them both.

292
00:36:46,240 --> 00:36:47,480
If she really went that far

293
00:36:47,600 --> 00:36:49,249
then just let her be.

294
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:53,200
The wicked will face their karma.

295
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:56,480
Stay this calm

296
00:36:56,680 --> 00:36:58,080
and you and your child

297
00:36:58,200 --> 00:37:00,547
will end up on the streets.

298
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:04,036
We have our own magic don't we?

299
00:37:04,600 --> 00:37:06,966
Nora dancers have their spells.

300
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:10,492
We can't just sit back and take this.

301
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:36,252
How can I just curse people for no reason?

302
00:37:36,520 --> 00:37:38,806
We don’t know
if they've done anything.

303
00:37:39,240 --> 00:37:42,264
No one can prove that Father.

304
00:37:42,520 --> 00:37:45,901
But she’s taking everything from us.

305
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:49,230
We're in deep trouble right now.

306
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:51,913
Our ancestral spells

307
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:54,953
are not for selfish gain.

308
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:56,781
Since you chose to be his wife

309
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:59,323
you must obey him.

310
00:37:59,960 --> 00:38:00,800
If you can't

311
00:38:01,160 --> 00:38:02,147
then walk away.

312
00:38:02,320 --> 00:38:03,649
Don't stay and suffer.

313
00:38:18,600 --> 00:38:19,778
I'm going to the capital.

314
00:38:21,040 --> 00:38:22,178
I need to know...

315
00:38:22,270 --> 00:38:23,513
the truth.

316
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,840
Before you leave do me a favor.

317
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,320
In two days

318
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,624
Father has a doctor's appointment.

319
00:38:30,120 --> 00:38:32,560
Khem keep him away
from the house for a bit.

320
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:34,252
What's your plan Bu- nga?

321
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:40,812
Father.

322
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:44,633
Why must we always pray to our ancestors?

323
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:47,403
When someone imparts knowledge

324
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:49,390
and protects you

325
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:51,655
you show gratitude don’t you?

326
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:53,907
It's the same with
our Nora ancestral spirits.

327
00:40:54,036 --> 00:40:55,440
If we need something

328
00:40:55,587 --> 00:40:58,153
we just ask them right?

329
00:41:00,880 --> 00:41:02,436
What is it that you want to ask for?

330
00:41:02,560 --> 00:41:06,418
With pure intentions they may grant it.

331
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:12,012
But remember the spirits

332
00:41:12,120 --> 00:41:13,981
are not for selfish gain.

333
00:41:51,969 --> 00:41:52,660
Master.

334
00:41:53,316 --> 00:41:54,540
I just remembered

335
00:41:54,713 --> 00:41:56,420
the headman wants us to stop by.

336
00:41:57,009 --> 00:41:58,740
He’s got some roasted cashews for us.

337
00:41:59,095 --> 00:41:59,780
Let's go.

338
00:41:59,858 --> 00:42:00,580
Let's go.

339
00:42:02,393 --> 00:42:03,260
Hey

340
00:42:05,981 --> 00:42:06,880
I'm scared

341
00:42:06,966 --> 00:42:07,820
I’m so frightened

342
00:42:10,660 --> 00:42:11,300
Help me

343
00:42:18,340 --> 00:42:18,900
Father

344
00:42:23,107 --> 00:42:23,860
You

345
00:42:24,123 --> 00:42:25,500
You were distracting me

346
00:42:57,538 --> 00:42:58,980
Ancestral spirits

347
00:42:59,729 --> 00:43:01,618
please do not punish her.

348
00:43:02,340 --> 00:43:03,440
She's foolish

349
00:43:04,676 --> 00:43:06,100
and naive.

350
00:43:06,467 --> 00:43:08,289
Please forgive her this one time.

351
00:43:09,181 --> 00:43:11,070
If she has done anything wrong

352
00:43:12,621 --> 00:43:14,935
I will take the blame upon myself.

353
00:43:48,473 --> 00:43:50,184
Is that Lukchan crying?

354
00:43:50,369 --> 00:43:51,710
Yes ma'am.

355
00:43:51,778 --> 00:43:53,900
She's the only baby here.

356
00:43:53,969 --> 00:43:58,141
The other children are all grown.

357
00:43:58,750 --> 00:44:02,596
Where is her mother?
Why leave the baby crying?

358
00:44:05,716 --> 00:44:06,900
Go check on her.

359
00:44:07,569 --> 00:44:09,380
Come on My Lady.

360
00:44:20,486 --> 00:44:23,316
Why are you crying?

361
00:44:25,956 --> 00:44:26,849
Stop it.

362
00:44:28,147 --> 00:44:30,060
Shh. Quiet now.

363
00:44:32,147 --> 00:44:34,135
I don’t even like children.

364
00:44:37,860 --> 00:44:39,580
Stop Stop it

365
00:44:43,372 --> 00:44:44,460
She finally stopped.

366
00:44:48,652 --> 00:44:50,340
I've never seen her up close.

367
00:44:50,480 --> 00:44:52,180
Is she this big already?

368
00:44:52,732 --> 00:44:54,620
She’s about six months old.

369
00:44:57,003 --> 00:44:58,500
So where did her mother go?

370
00:44:59,267 --> 00:45:01,540
She probably went to visit the father.

371
00:45:01,753 --> 00:45:03,820
She asked Lady Mok to look after her.

372
00:45:04,184 --> 00:45:07,840
But she’s gone leaving the baby all alone.

373
00:45:13,655 --> 00:45:14,340
Come.

374
00:45:14,621 --> 00:45:16,092
Let me hold her.

375
00:45:17,366 --> 00:45:18,300
Phon

376
00:45:20,049 --> 00:45:21,020
Phon

377
00:45:23,390 --> 00:45:25,220
Why do you want to hold her?

378
00:45:33,704 --> 00:45:35,300
I want a grandchild

379
00:45:35,550 --> 00:45:37,260
not her mother.

380
00:45:37,981 --> 00:45:41,360
Wait for Thep and Ploy’s child.

381
00:45:42,080 --> 00:45:46,313
They’ll be much cuter

382
00:45:46,843 --> 00:45:49,224
You might even get a grandson

383
00:45:50,300 --> 00:45:51,820
It’s been five months

384
00:45:51,870 --> 00:45:53,500
yet no sign of a baby.

385
00:45:54,393 --> 00:45:57,353
Besides I’m fed up with Bu- nga.

386
00:45:59,460 --> 00:46:00,860
Help me think.

387
00:46:01,218 --> 00:46:02,700
What can we do?

388
00:46:26,043 --> 00:46:28,620
Please don't hurt me.
I'm scared.

389
00:46:29,220 --> 00:46:30,806
They were bullying me

390
00:46:31,304 --> 00:46:34,740
I didn't mean to be disrespectful.

391
00:46:36,215 --> 00:46:39,260
Please don't hurt me

392
00:46:39,900 --> 00:46:42,020
They all bullied me... I’m sorry.

393
00:46:52,295 --> 00:46:55,156
Why didn't the spirits curse you

394
00:46:57,926 --> 00:47:00,252
for stealing everything from me?

395
00:47:01,107 --> 00:47:02,504
Why is your life so perfect?

396
00:47:03,323 --> 00:47:05,015
Why aren't you rotting in hell?

397
00:47:09,150 --> 00:47:11,790
I don't know what I did.

398
00:47:12,996 --> 00:47:15,335
If you kill me now

399
00:47:16,301 --> 00:47:18,036
you’ll only add to your karma.

400
00:47:18,960 --> 00:47:20,676
But if you let me go

401
00:47:21,580 --> 00:47:22,180
I will...

402
00:47:22,252 --> 00:47:24,180
make merit for you.

403
00:47:34,621 --> 00:47:36,621
You think merit will help?

404
00:47:38,252 --> 00:47:40,252
Worry about yourself

405
00:47:52,775 --> 00:47:53,780
Hey

406
00:47:54,104 --> 00:47:54,780
Any luck?

407
00:47:54,855 --> 00:47:56,060
Have you found Ploy?

408
00:47:56,246 --> 00:47:57,340
No sign of her.

409
00:47:57,538 --> 00:47:58,260
And...

410
00:47:58,332 --> 00:48:00,000
did you see Inspector Ong?

411
00:48:00,486 --> 00:48:01,340
Yes I did.

412
00:48:01,723 --> 00:48:03,060
He promised to help.

413
00:48:03,372 --> 00:48:05,900
He’s checking the security cameras.

414
00:48:05,987 --> 00:48:07,380
Anyway thank you so much.

415
00:48:07,483 --> 00:48:09,833
You’ve really helped us out.

416
00:48:09,895 --> 00:48:10,740
Come on.

417
00:48:10,824 --> 00:48:11,620
Don't mention it.

418
00:48:12,418 --> 00:48:13,380
By the way

419
00:48:14,738 --> 00:48:16,700
Did a student named Busaban

420
00:48:16,830 --> 00:48:18,043
attend the exam this morning?

421
00:48:19,501 --> 00:48:20,700
A sophomore?

422
00:48:20,775 --> 00:48:21,420
Yeah.

423
00:48:21,760 --> 00:48:23,820
Is there a student named Busaban?

424
00:48:30,381 --> 00:48:32,020
Is she in our major?

425
00:48:32,209 --> 00:48:33,860
Yes I remember her.

426
00:48:34,215 --> 00:48:35,740
She always sits here.

427
00:48:45,969 --> 00:48:48,455
No one ever sits there.

428
00:48:49,046 --> 00:48:50,060
Yes they do.

429
00:48:51,815 --> 00:48:53,660
I've even used this computer.

430
00:48:54,683 --> 00:48:55,540
Professor

431
00:48:55,649 --> 00:48:57,778
that one's been broken since last term.

432
00:48:58,024 --> 00:49:00,060
Are you sure it's this class?

433
00:49:00,276 --> 00:49:01,460
Maybe another major.

434
00:49:19,778 --> 00:49:20,793
Oh hey

435
00:49:20,996 --> 00:49:22,180
Here you are.

436
00:49:22,652 --> 00:49:24,580
I had the registrar's office check.

437
00:49:24,627 --> 00:49:25,741
Our faculty...

438
00:49:25,780 --> 00:49:28,787
has no student named Busaban.

439
00:49:38,049 --> 00:49:40,020
Hello this is Chanchao's father.

440
00:49:40,498 --> 00:49:42,660
Besides me and her Mom

441
00:49:42,923 --> 00:49:46,553
make sure no one else picks her up.

442
00:49:47,655 --> 00:49:48,380
Yes.

443
00:49:48,980 --> 00:49:49,900
Thank you very much.

444
00:49:51,421 --> 00:49:52,100
Hey

445
00:49:52,683 --> 00:49:53,460
what's wrong?

446
00:49:55,181 --> 00:49:56,660
I'll tell you later.

447
00:50:12,652 --> 00:50:13,660
Jomthap

448
00:50:14,658 --> 00:50:15,460
Sorry.

449
00:50:15,686 --> 00:50:17,820
I was getting my wounds treated.

450
00:50:18,326 --> 00:50:19,580
Have you found Ploy?

451
00:50:19,993 --> 00:50:20,980
Not yet.

452
00:50:21,132 --> 00:50:22,340
I thought you were home.

453
00:50:22,516 --> 00:50:24,580
Did Busaban go to your house?

454
00:50:24,780 --> 00:50:25,380
Why?

455
00:50:25,815 --> 00:50:26,700
Is something wrong?

456
00:50:26,984 --> 00:50:28,060
Then be careful.

457
00:50:28,129 --> 00:50:29,540
- She might be armed.
- Okay.

458
00:50:30,049 --> 00:50:31,140
I'm heading home now.

459
00:50:31,220 --> 00:50:32,500
I'll check when I arrive.

460
00:50:32,806 --> 00:50:33,700
Alright.

461
00:50:49,649 --> 00:50:52,180
You’ve kept what’s mine

462
00:50:52,467 --> 00:50:54,147
for too long.

463
00:50:55,544 --> 00:50:57,260
What do you want from me?

464
00:50:57,673 --> 00:50:58,860
Your life.

465
00:51:03,563 --> 00:51:04,540
Fine.

466
00:51:05,458 --> 00:51:07,403
I can't do anything to you right now.

467
00:51:07,729 --> 00:51:10,467
If I die like this

468
00:51:10,664 --> 00:51:13,452
I’ll return as a ghost just like you.

469
00:51:14,123 --> 00:51:17,796
Then we can fight on equal terms.

470
00:51:18,375 --> 00:51:20,060
And you will know

471
00:51:20,264 --> 00:51:21,913
just how agonizing

472
00:51:22,380 --> 00:51:24,203
my suffering has been.

473
00:51:31,716 --> 00:51:33,089
Leave the baby.

474
00:51:33,803 --> 00:51:37,218
Take this and find a man you deserve.

475
00:51:37,803 --> 00:51:40,455
If that's what Thep really wants

476
00:51:40,978 --> 00:51:42,172
I will leave.

477
00:51:42,966 --> 00:51:44,880
I won't take a single cent.

478
00:51:45,501 --> 00:51:46,387
Bu- nga

479
00:51:48,116 --> 00:51:49,495
How's Father?

480
00:51:49,980 --> 00:51:50,980
Go check on him.

481
00:51:56,740 --> 00:51:57,820
Give me your baby.

482
00:51:57,940 --> 00:51:59,180
Why do you want her?

483
00:51:59,380 --> 00:52:00,860
Someone wants her.

484
00:52:01,300 --> 00:52:02,060
Die

485
00:52:13,220 --> 00:52:13,780
Bu- nga

486
00:52:13,900 --> 00:52:14,860
Run

487
00:52:19,156 --> 00:52:21,020
My baby My baby

488
00:52:37,340 --> 00:52:38,940
Bu- nga don't

489
00:52:41,380 --> 00:52:43,260
I got the CCTV footage.

490
00:52:43,495 --> 00:52:46,676
You were talking to someone
who isn't there.

491
00:52:46,793 --> 00:52:48,420
The person you met

492
00:52:48,467 --> 00:52:49,700
isn't a scammer.

493
00:52:49,784 --> 00:52:50,860
In fact...

494
00:52:51,046 --> 00:52:52,340
she isn't even human.

495
00:52:57,353 --> 00:52:58,940
You're finally here.

496
00:52:59,243 --> 00:53:00,683
The problem you're facing

497
00:53:01,452 --> 00:53:02,940
the police can't help you with this.

498
00:53:04,769 --> 00:53:06,652
This necklace will protect you.

499
00:53:13,390 --> 00:53:14,780
We found Mom.

500
00:53:16,793 --> 00:53:17,780
Mommy

501
00:53:31,353 --> 00:53:32,393
Ploy

502
00:53:36,886 --> 00:53:38,036
Ploy
